 {{#lst:Tusk/Snowball Properties|Table0}}

* {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
** Does not gather the following units or units affected by the following sources
*** {{A|Batrider|Flaming Lasso}}
*** {{A|Enigma|Black Hole}}
*** {{A|Faceless Void|Chronosphere}}
*** {{A|Primal Beast|Pulverize}}
*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
*** {{M|Disable Help}} on Tusk prevents Snowball from gathering the allied hero.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Snowball}}
*** Displays the gathered [[minimap]] icon for allied heroes, {{M|clones}}, and {{M|illusions}}.
**** Other gathered units displays a [[File:Dota2 Tusk Question icon.png|21px]] black-circled question mark.
**** The indicator has a 6-second duration and expires in the following conditions:
***** Upon Tusk's {{M|death}}.
***** After the Snowball disappears.
***** When the Snowball does not connect to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** A Snowball indicator appears on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy, visible to Tusk's allies only.

* This ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Snowball}}
*** Does not {{M|disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}} for gathered units.
*** Applies the following ability effects on all gathered units:
**** {{M|Hidden}}
**** {{M|Invulnerable}}
**** {{M|Spell immune}}
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
***** Applies the following additional ability effects on allied units:
****** {{M|Cannot act}}.
****** Can be forced out of the Snowball with {{M|teleport}} sources, without reducing the {{A|Tusk|Launch Snowball}} gathered damage.
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***** Applies the following additional ability effects on self:
****** {{M|Disarm}}
****** {{M|Root}}
****** {{M|Mute}}
****** Can cast other abilities, except the following abilities:
******* {{A|Tusk|Drinking Buddies}}
******* {{A|Tusk|Walrus Kick}}
******* {{A|Tusk|Walrus PUNCH!}}
****** Cannot exit the Snowball in any way.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|tusk_snowball_visible}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Vision|Base}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Applies the following [[vision]] components on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy until the Snowball stops:
**** {{M|Expose}}
***** This reveals units affected by {{A|Slark|Shadow Dance}}, {{A|Slark|Depth Shroud}}.
***** However, this does not grant {{M|True Sight}}.
**** {{M|Shared vision}}

