{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Snowball
| desc = Launches the Snowball toward and only affects the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} primary unit-targeted enemy.
| structure = hidden
}}

 * {{Symbol|a|Sub}}
** Replaces {{A|Tusk|Snowball}} until this [[sub-ability]] is used, upon {{M|projectile}} impact on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy, or expires.
** Snowball cannot be leveled up while this sub-ability is active.
** Cannot be {{M|shift-queued}}.

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Snowball}}
** The launched Snowball has two main components with the following properties:
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Speed}}
**** Has {{#var:Launch Snowball value1}}-speed, and can travel up to from point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] to point [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|R|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|Q|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|S|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] distance respectively per ability level correspondingly to its max chase duration.
**** Chases the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy up to {{#var:Launch Snowball value2}} seconds once it is launched.
***** Hence, the launched Snowball can travel for {{Code|Line OP/OQ/OR/OS}} up to a max {{Code|{{calc|v1*{{#var:Launch Snowball value2}}|v1={{#var:Launch Snowball value1}}}}-distance}} respectively.
*** [[File:Dota2 Tusk Launch Snowball Visualization icon.png|384px]]
**** Line [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] is the cast range.
**** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{calc|({{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value1}}+{{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value2}}*{{#var:Snowball value1}})+(v1*{{#var:Launch Snowball value2}})|v1={{#var:Launch Snowball value1}}}} distance away with the travel speed and with the max [[effect radius]] increase.
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|a|Up}}
**** {{Symbol|a|Counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}}
***** Increases by {{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value2}} radius per hold second, up to a max {{calc|{{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value1}}+{{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value2}}*v1|v1=0/1/2/3}} radius.
***** {{Symbol|Trees}}
****** [[Trees]] the Snowball come in contact while rolling forward are destroyed within its effect radius.
**** {{Symbol|Stun}} + {{Symbol|Damage|Magical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}}
***** Considers the following gathered allied units as heroes:
****** {{M|Clones}}
****** {{M|Invulnerable}} heroes.
***** Considers the following gathered allied units as creeps:
****** {{H|Tusk|x}} himself and his {{M|Courier}}.
******* Hence, only the base damage is applied when no other allied heroes are gathered.
****** {{M|Creep-heroes}}
****** {{M|Illusions}}
****** {{M|Summons}}
***** Does not gather the following units or units affected by the following sources:
****** {{A|Batrider|Flaming Lasso}}
****** {{A|Enigma|Black Hole}}
****** {{A|Faceless Void|Chronosphere}}
****** {{A|Primal Beast|Pulverize}}
****** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
****** {{M|Hidden}} units.
****** {{M|Disable Help}} on Tusk prevents Snowball from gathering the allied hero.
***** However, attempting to gather any allied heroes affected by the aformentioned sources still adds to the {{A|Tusk|Launch Snowball}} gathered damage.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**# {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[stun]]ned}}
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**# Tusk is issued an attack order on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy upon the {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|stunned}} debuff application, regardless of auto-attack settings.
**# {{M|Dispels}} the following modifiers:
**#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|tusk_snowball_movement_friendly}}
**#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|tusk_snowball_target}}

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} Effect radius: {{Code|{{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value1}} + {{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value2}} × f(HoldDuration) , MAX HoldDuration {{=}} 0/1/2/3}}
** {{M|Stun}} duration: {{Code|{{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value4}} + {{#var:Launch Snowball type2 value2}} × f(OtherHeroes)}}
** {{M|Magical}} {{M|spell damage}}: {{Code|{{#var:Launch Snowball type1 value3}} + {{#var:Launch Snowball type2 value1}} × f(OtherHeroes)}}

